 for one level  to supervise the work of the level below  and it must be easy for workers at any  level to put forward ideas about changes  that can help improve the whole  structure the village health workers  being closest to the people have a voice  that should be heard  these are only six examples of trends in  rural health care  other countries will find their own ways  drawing on their own traditions  but seeking the same goal a better life  for all their people  [Music]  [Music]  you

